### ============================================================================
### File: docs/api-tests/08-dashboard.http
### Purpose: Manual and automated HTTP requests for Module 8 (Dashboard: UC-32)
### Compatible with: VS Code REST Client, Thunder Client, and IntelliJ HTTP Client
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminEmail = admin@mygodown.com
@adminPassword = AdminPassword123!
@managerEmail = manager@mygodown.com
@managerPassword = ManagerPassword123!
@staffEmail = staff@mygodown.com
@staffPassword = StaffPassword123!

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Authenticate as Administrator
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Store admin token
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Authenticate as Warehouse Manager
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name managerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{managerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{managerPassword}}"
}

### Store manager token
@managerToken = {{managerLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Authenticate as Staff
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name staffLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{staffEmail}}",
  "password": "{{staffPassword}}"
}

### Store staff token
@staffToken = {{staffLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### ============================================================================
### UC-32: View Dashboard Summary
### ============================================================================

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Admin views dashboard summary (Returns all metrics including stockValue)
### Expected: 200 OK with totalActiveProducts, totalStockUnits, stockValue,
###           lowStockCount, openPurchaseOrders, openSalesOrders,
###           stockByWarehouse, and recentMovements.
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getDashboardSummaryAdmin
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Warehouse Manager views dashboard summary (Returns all metrics with stockValue)
### Expected: 200 OK with stockValue present
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getDashboardSummaryManager
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Staff views dashboard summary (BR-05: stockValue STRICTLY OMITTED)
### Expected: 200 OK with operational metrics, but stockValue key does NOT exist
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getDashboardSummaryStaff
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Unauthenticated request to dashboard summary
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized with standard error envelope
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getDashboardSummaryUnauth
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Accept: application/json
